fixture ddash_stairs_relanding_keeps_speed
doc (physics review 6, M2) a down-right air dash from (292, 193) down test/ddash_stairs: it touches down on the first steps and runs off them; on dash frame 8 (tick 7) it comes down on the far edge of the step at x 369..388 (top y 257). Every dash frame carries the dash's 14.14 u across (BUILD.md s5 Dash: 180 u in 9 f); the re-landing took the far-edge contact (3.9 u) and dropped the rest of the tick's step.
room test/ddash_stairs
spawn 292 193
frames 12
input
  0 R D dash
  1..11 R D
end
expect
  at 7 x>=14u+x@6
end
